---
import '@fontsource-variable/instrument-sans/wdth.css';
const github = 'https://github.com/4nonX/interlinea';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Privacy: Interlinea</title>
<meta name="description" content="What interlinea.dev and the Interlinea apps do with your data.">
<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#f3f5f8">
<style is:inline>
body { margin: 0; background: #f3f5f8; color: #1a1f26; font: 400 17px/1.6 "Instrument Sans Variable", system-ui, sans-serif; }
main { max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 64px 24px 96px; }
a { color: #1a4aae; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
h1 { font-weight: 500; font-size: 40px; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.028em; margin: 32px 0 24px; }
h2 { font-weight: 500; font-size: 22px; margin: 40px 0 8px; }
.back { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-weight: 500; color: #1a1f26; text-decoration: none; }
.back svg { width: 24px; height: 24px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
  <a class="back" href="/"><svg viewBox="0 0 512 512" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="32" y="32" width="448" height="448" rx="112" fill="#1f5bd6"/><rect x="128" y="160" width="256" height="32" rx="16" fill="#fff"/><rect x="128" y="240" width="176" height="32" rx="16" fill="#fff" fill-opacity=".55"/><rect x="128" y="320" width="256" height="32" rx="16" fill="#fff"/></svg>Interlinea</a>
  <h1>Privacy</h1>
  <p>This site sets no cookies, runs no analytics and loads nothing from other servers: its fonts and scripts are served from interlinea.dev itself.</p>
  <h2>Hosting</h2>
  <p>The site is hosted on GitHub Pages. GitHub records the address of every visitor in its server logs, for security, as its <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement">privacy statement</a> describes. The downloads are served by GitHub from the project's releases.</p>
  <h2>The browser client</h2>
  <p>The browser client at <a href="/app/">interlinea.dev/app</a> keeps your projects, memories and termbases in your browser, on your computer. They are not sent to this site. Translation services you turn on are reached with your own key, from your browser, under their own terms.</p>
  <h2>The desktop app</h2>
  <p>The desktop app keeps your work in a folder on your computer and sends nothing anywhere unless you sign in to a team server or turn on a translation service.</p>
  <h2>Questions</h2>
  <p>Questions about this page can be asked in the project's <a href={`${github}/issues`}>issues on GitHub</a>.</p>
</main>
</body>
</html>
